@FinShark_HostAddress = http://localhost:5253

### Stocks — كل الأسهم (Session 3)
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock
Accept: application/json

### Stocks — Filtering + Sorting + Pagination (Session 7)
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock?symbol=FS&sortBy=Purchase&isDescending=true&pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Stock by id (مع التعليقات — Include)
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock/1
Accept: application/json

### Stock by symbol
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock/symbol/AAPL
Accept: application/json

### Create stock (201 / 400 / 409)
POST {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "MSFT",
  "companyName": "Microsoft Corp.",
  "purchase": 300.5,
  "lastDiv": 0.75,
  "industry": "Tech",
  "marketCap": 3000000000000
}

### Update stock
PUT {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "companyName": "Apple Inc.",
  "purchase": 175,
  "lastDiv": 0.25,
  "industry": "Tech",
  "marketCap": 2900000000000
}

### Delete stock (204 / 404)
DELETE {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/stock/2

### Comments — تعليق جديد على السهم رقم 1 (Session 6)
POST {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/comment/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Great stock",
  "content": "Strong earnings this quarter."
}

### All comments
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/comment
Accept: application/json

### Comments on a stock
GET {{FinShark_HostAddress}}/api/comment?stockId=1
Accept: application/json
